---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-forest">
	<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
		<img
			src={`${base}images/hero-bg-portrait.png`}
			alt=""
			class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[75%_center] lg:object-right"
		/>
		<div
			class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-forest via-forest/80 to-transparent lg:w-2/3 lg:via-forest/40"
		>
		</div>
		<div
			class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-forest to-transparent"
		>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div
		class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid min-h-[600px] max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:gap-4 lg:py-24"
	>
		<div class="max-w-xl pt-10 lg:pt-0">
			<h1
				class="font-display text-4xl leading-[1.08] font-bold tracking-wide text-gold uppercase sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.25rem]"
			>
				Turning Complexity<br class="hidden sm:block" /> into Action
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-white/90 sm:text-lg">
				Panchalee.Connect helps healthcare organizations, professional societies, and public-sector
				stakeholders align people, systems and strategy to create measurable impact.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80 sm:text-base">
				When important initiatives involve multiple stakeholders, competing priorities and complex systems,
				Panchalee.Connect creates clarity, alignment and execution.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
				<a
					href="#contact"
					class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-gold px-5 py-3.5 font-sans text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-forest transition hover:bg-gold-light"
				>
					Let's Start With Your Challenge
					<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
				</a>
				<a
					href="#expertise"
					class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-gold px-5 py-3.5 font-sans text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-gold transition hover:bg-gold/10"
				>
					Explore Our Expertise
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="relative mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-md flex-col justify-end lg:max-w-none lg:pb-10">
			<blockquote
				class="relative mx-4 mt-auto rounded-sm border border-gold/20 bg-forest/40 p-5 backdrop-blur-md sm:mx-0 sm:mr-auto sm:max-w-xs lg:ml-0 lg:-translate-x-8"
			>
				<p
					class="font-display text-lg leading-snug text-gold italic sm:text-xl"
				>
					<span class="mr-1 text-3xl leading-none text-gold/70">“</span>
					Connection creates alignment. Alignment drives impact.
					<span class="ml-1 text-3xl leading-none text-gold/70">”</span>
				</p>
			</blockquote>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
